# Keep the marketplace vendor lean.
#
# `git archive` (used by shrimpshack vendoring to snapshot a plugin into
# ~/.claude/plugins/marketplaces/shrimpshack/plugins/claude-modes/) honors
# `export-ignore` and skips matching paths. These docs are development
# artifacts — brainstorm transcripts, plan documents, and spike results
# captured during 0.2.x → 0.3.0 work. They're useful in the source repo
# (and worth keeping in git history) but bloat installed plugins for
# every downstream user without adding runtime value.
#
# Solutions docs (docs/solutions/) are intentionally NOT export-ignored —
# they're learning artifacts that downstream readers may want to consult
# (e.g. docs/solutions/2026-05-25-plugin-shipped-agents.md documents the
# precedent the in-flow editor agent set). If that ever changes, drop a
# rule below.

docs/brainstorms/ export-ignore
docs/plans/ export-ignore
docs/spikes/ export-ignore
